OL,3,GNEWSAWhy changing climate and large
OL,4,Abills are putting soft play centres at
OL,5,Arisk
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey are the indoor centres of fun that
OL,8,Fare perfect for an energetic play date.
OL,10,FBut the owner of one soft play business
OL,11,Fsays it is in danger of closure as the
OL,12,Fhot summer has meant she struggled to
OL,13,Fget people through the doors.
OL,15,FJessica Harvey has run Funzone in
OL,16,FWhitchurch for over a year, and said as
OL,17,Fthe industry is seasonal, there were
OL,18,Foccasions when she was the only one
OL,19,Fthere all day.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
