OL,3,GNEWSAWhy changing climate and large
OL,4,Abills are putting soft play centres at
OL,5,Arisk
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Over the summer, there has definitely
OL,8,Fbeen [times] where we probably had 10
OL,9,Fto 15 people in all week, which just
OL,10,Fisn't sustainable," she said.
